      "writtenOn": "2022-02-01T16:20:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Decided to change this to clarify. In aosp/1967240 :\n• I changed semantics to store caps unsanitized and renamed the member to declaredCapabilitiesUnsanitized\n• Moved the assignment to the two callers and renamed this method sanitizeCapabilitiesFromAgent\n• Called sanitize in the one place making use of the declared capabilities.\nThere is a minor performance hit as VPNs now create and sanitize a NC every time their underlying networks change. I think it\u0027s a lot clearer and safer though.",
